data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"lookupStatus\": \"found\",\n    \"comments\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDoxNjQwNjc4OTUwNTgyMDU4XzE2NDA2ODA5NjA1ODE4NTc=\",\n        \"text\": \"Check out Coach Renee Lopez - see what can be done\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T14:33:33.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 8,\n        \"reactionCount\": 10,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Frank Peña\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid0RpASvkmCXYTpGtkoYJzTbS2GAVYAdVc9gES3YcsxhrowQGBjBfCZ6Brc2TQjiscwl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Frank\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDoxNjQwNjc4OTUwNTgyMDU4XzE2NDA2ODM1MjcyNDgyNjc=\",\n        \"text\": \"Coming from a guy who played juco baseball and went through the recruiting process. Twitter (X) is the best platform to use for recruitment. Create highlight videos to post on there and tag baseball pages who post and reshare video. For me emails did not work either but once he starts getting followed by coaches, he can message them through twitter to start a line of communication between them\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T14:37:18.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 22,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"ElegantSpinach2941\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"2172795276862866\",\n          \"shortName\": null\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDoxNjQwNjc4OTUwNTgyMDU4XzE2NDA3MDY4NzM5MTI1OTk=\",\n        \"text\": \"Download the Field level App. $50/month until you dont want it any longer. Put in school size, location, stats ETC to find schools that fit he wants. You can also go to a section called Recruiting Needs. This section is where coaches advertise what they are specifically looking for. My son got 7 or 8 offers just doing field level. Some offered money some did not. A lot of D3, smaller Jucos, USCAA, and NAIA are on there actively recruiting all over. If he is willing to go out of state there are plenty of opportunities. My son committed recently. Again all from field level. You can message up to 20 schools a month with that package\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T15:14:49.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 17,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Daniel Thess\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"100000024711819\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Daniel\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDoxNjQwNjc4OTUwNTgyMDU4XzE2NDA2ODI0OTM5MTUwMzc=\",\n        \"text\": \"It's not too late, my son didnt commit until after graduation\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T14:35:44.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 14,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Lals TA\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid02P4AoedBD2xirrXVFYQK9AWZfBCtQVsyQWzYR4eFYWJm9NJ1iyNg4CgNTk5uw2Jx4l\",\n          \"shortName\": \"TA\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDoxNjQwNjc4OTUwNTgyMDU4XzE2NDA3NzY2MzA1NzIyOTA=\",\n        \"text\": \"I don’t understand , seniors are 17/18 years old. Fully capable of “figuring” this stuff out alone a if they really cared. \\n\\nWhen I was a senior back in the 90’s nobody helped “recruit” me. My junior year I worked at dominoes pizza, played 3 sports , and reached out to local juco’s and colleges and went off to play after senior year. \\n\\nMEN can drive at 16 \\n\\nWhat’s happening to our society and our men has become clear to me over the last 3 decades\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T17:11:01.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 4,\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Kirk Mayer\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"100001733491333\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Kirk\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDoxNjQwNjc4OTUwNTgyMDU4XzE2NDA2ODgyNDM5MTQ0NjI=\",\n        \"text\": \"It's not about the quality of the video - it's about him contacting coaches. Other people have recommended Renee Lopez. Find her page on FB called Educating Parents of HS Athletes on the College Recruiting Process\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T14:44:50.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 6,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"BronzeCapybara3442\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"968706332777278\",\n          \"shortName\": null\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDoxNjQwNjc4OTUwNTgyMDU4XzE2NDA3MDU5NTM5MTI2OTE=\",\n        \"text\": \"Check out Renee Lopez's page and DO NOT pay for a recruiter, they are a waste of money.\\n\\nhttps://www.facebook.com/share/1G3H5qFuxL/\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T15:13:28.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 7,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Karen Neilson\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid0vD3yczAaLh1wwiXXtKJPQTct85F4abWDWHpWGgAnjyihvWTzTjq1NXhaVun6y9cTl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Karen\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDoxNjQwNjc4OTUwNTgyMDU4XzE2NDA2ODIxOTA1ODE3MzQ=\",\n        \"text\": \"I feel your pain. Since I don't know your son or his ability, I won't comment on his odds of walking on somewhere. Have you considered a post-grad program? He could play, get stronger, play against other post-grad and college teams, take classes at a local community college, and not use a year of eligibility.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T14:35:12.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 9,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Eric Batchler\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid0DYmZLaRH8Mgr6kZtnWLQaMepG6VVxUzjTM5vXECwEbDrJFex66ZvDBjKT8t8wsyzl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Eric\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDoxNjQwNjc4OTUwNTgyMDU4XzE2NDA2OTA1MjM5MTQyMzQ=\",\n        \"text\": \"Create a profile on field level  he can add video and send to coaches directly. Might be worth paying the fee over the next few months to fully max use. It's not crazy expensive. Add and follow schools etc.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T14:48:54.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 5,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Amanda Allison-Vest\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"1366989397\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Amanda\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDoxNjQwNjc4OTUwNTgyMDU4XzE2NDA4MjQ5NTcyMzQxMjQ=\",\n        \"text\": \"There a myriad if levels of collegiate baseball that he can explore.  He needs to do some leg work if he wants to play\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T18:39:34.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 3,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Johnathan Smith\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid02HZVedErr43juY7spfgLqjJENiEE4sEnGG4ikipdzHA9apqEt4y4rJkJFWCjPjFaBl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Johnathan\"\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"page\": {\n      \"nextCursor\": \"MToxNzkzOTg0NjAxOgF_lY3Ua96hoaoNJ2MUcM5eIwAOjb94YDpmYjXY7q_X3wRSt9Hr09yuhEum6ljrG3KBlCGYMbX_X3GLCV4wsIop0gVRprjT7ovZ0HBZkn2oVNKbvaJr2pHQyQxa5k_suZkRIa0uzgcobjjaBakH1hWRZsuj8ha8mUWj-9MlQqgqiRnwtIZTBcm90ApeI933aW5hbomX-BX-xfBSRc6FOz74oFCspUKxVQYSEgYADsmGaqf5LjRAYA1rsidiDdBFxe6vk5g3jv_ON1cRrd-Ia7DPmhsEMOgoNKV-u70-9FnmFKZItDk05Rwb9RQE72Ndq8Dhy1mj5gqARyn9Li5cV4c3W0s2g58OEQqZYl1VSu8j3lmN_xBWlkk9XMehuyDzhW9dRs_v10z3WMqv5EJ1nChOpZGjV7tC6NsFmzgSp5VfOb8ms_hA0iNz7Uw\",\n      \"hasMore\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"requestId\": \"req_4ac140f3-4b25-435f-939f-072952d285d9\",\n    \"creditsCharged\": 1,\n    \"version\": \"v1\"\n  }\n}